  "expressions":[[1,"That's the tallest dinosaur in this hall.","那是这个厅里最高的恐龙。",4],[1,"It's taller than both of us together.","它比我们加起来还高。",4],[1,"How tall are you?","你有多高？",4],[1,"I'm 1.65 metres.","我身高 1.65 米。",4],[1,"What size are your shoes, Mike?","迈克，你穿多大号的鞋？",6],[1,"Your feet are bigger than mine. My shoes are size 37.","你的脚比我的大。我穿 37 号的鞋。",6],[1,"How heavy are you?","你体重多少？",6],[1,"I'm 48 kilograms.","我体重 48 公斤。",6],
  [2,"How was your weekend?","你周末过得怎么样？",14],[2,"It was good, thank you.","很好，谢谢。",14],[2,"What did you do?","你（周末）干什么了？",14],[2,"I stayed at home with your grandma. We drank tea in the afternoon and watched TV.","我和你外婆待在家里。我们喝了下午茶，还看了电视。",14],[2,"Did you do anything else?","你还做了其他什么事吗？",14],[2,"Yes, I cleaned my room and washed my clothes.","是的，我打扫了房间，还洗了衣服。",14],[2,"I want to buy the new film magazine.","我想买期新的电影杂志。",16],[2,"What did you do last weekend?","你上周末干什么了？",16],[2,"Did you see a film?","你看电影了吗？",16],[2,"No, I had a cold. I stayed at home all weekend and slept.","没有，我感冒了。整个周末都待在家里睡觉。",16],
  [3,"What happened?","怎么了？",24],[3,"Are you all right?","你还好吧？",24],[3,"I'm OK now.","我现在没事了。",24],[3,"Where did you go?","你去哪儿了？",24],[3,"It looks like a mule!","它看起来像头骡子！",24],[3,"Did you go to Turpan?","你们去吐鲁番了吗？",24],[3,"Yes, we did.","是的，去了。",24],[3,"How did you go there?","你们怎么去的？",26],[3,"We went there by plane.","我们坐飞机去的。",26],[3,"Sounds great!","听上去不错！",26],
  [4,"There was no library in my old school.","我以前的学校里没有图书馆。",34],[4,"Tell us about your school, please.","请给我们讲讲您的学校吧。",34],[4,"How do you know that?","你怎么知道的？",34],[4,"There were no computers or Internet in my time.","我那时候没有电脑也没有网络。",34],[4,"Before, I was quiet. Now, I'm very active in class.","以前我很安静。现在我在课堂上很活跃。",36],[4,"I was short, so I couldn't ride my bike well. Now, I go cycling every day.","我以前个子小，自行车骑得不好。现在我天天骑车。",36]],
